{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31480","headline":"法华微上人盛话金山境胜旧游在目吟成此篇 · 李羣玉","name":"法华微上人盛话金山境胜旧游在目吟成此篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上青莲宫，人间蓬莱岛。\n烟霞与波浪，隐暎楼台好。\n潮门梵音静，海日天光早。\n愿与灵鹫人，吟经此终老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}